# Licensing

This repository contains two categories of content licensed under different terms.

---

## Code - Apache License 2.0

All source code in this repository is licensed under the
**Apache License, Version 2.0**.

This includes:

- `ihbenchmark/` — benchmark library source code
- `ihbenchmark-vis/` — visualisation source code
- `scripts/` — utility and evaluation scripts
- `tests/` — unit tests
- `config/` — configuration files
- `pyproject.toml` and other build/packaging files

Full license text: [`LICENSE_CODE`](LICENSE_CODE)

---

## Data - Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)

All dataset and materials content in this repository is licensed under
**Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)**.

This includes:

- `data/` — benchmark dataset
- `materials/` — model outputs, traces, evaluation results, analysis-ready result files

Full license text: [`LICENSE_DATA`](LICENSE_DATA)

---

For questions about permitted use, please refer to the respective license texts linked above.
